      "content": "Input  dry  contact  ports  include  power  on,  power  off,  bypass  output,  and  emergency  power  off (EPO). Customizable functions of IN-1 and IN-2: close dry contact function, power on, generator access (auxiliary contact), battery switch closure (auxiliary contact), external maintenance bypass",
